      "kind": "product",
      "identityStatus": "resolved",
      "categoryID": 2,
      "benefits": "Human trial evidence supports weight reduction with subcutaneous cagrilintide in adults with overweight or obesity without diabetes. A randomized phase 2 trial found greater body-weight loss than placebo over 26 weeks. This is investigational weight-management evidence and does not establish benefits for every formulation, route, or combination sold as a stack."
    }
